<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="A3.SS2.6" class="ltx_text">C-B</span> </span><span id="A3.SS2.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Execution Failure</span></h3>

<div id="A3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The concrete planner can successfully match a pair of abstract and concrete tools, but the input / output mapping may be erroneous.
We present an example of how our executor component fails to run apps matched in such a way.
The code fails to execute as it incorrectly assumes that ‘size’ is a key of the result returned by the app, which is incorrect.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.SS2.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="72.42" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 72.42" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,72.42) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#333333;" fill="#333333" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 67.79 C 0 70.35 2.07 72.42 4.63 72.42 L 472.75 72.42 C 475.3 72.42 477.38 70.35 477.38 67.79 L 477.38 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#E8E8E8;" fill="#E8E8E8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 0.69 L 0.69 50.98 L 476.68 50.98 L 476.68 0.69 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#E6E6E6;" fill="#E6E6E6"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 72.42 M 0 72.42 L 0 72.42 L 497.06 72.42 L 497.06 72.42 Z M 497.06 72.42"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 15.7 58.3)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.03em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.18" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.49)" width="387.86"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
